{"title": "Silent", "pageid": 17132, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Silent", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Silence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Silence.webp/300px-Silence.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Silence.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Silence.webp/300px-Silence.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Silence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Silent</b> is a Passive Feature that prevent a creature from casting spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature can't speak or cast spells that have a verbal component \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodmarrow_Skeleton\" title=\"Bloodmarrow Skeleton\">Bloodmarrow Skeleton</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Shepherd\" title=\"Death Shepherd\">Death Shepherd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Champion\" title=\"Fallen Champion\">Fallen Champion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Fighter\" title=\"Fallen Fighter\">Fallen Fighter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Ranger\" title=\"Fallen Ranger\">Fallen Ranger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garret_Dortmell\" title=\"Garret Dortmell\">Garret Dortmell</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Skeleton\" title=\"Giant Skeleton\">Giant Skeleton</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Godey\" title=\"Godey\">Godey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Necromite\" title=\"Necromite\">Necromite</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton\">Skeleton</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Unlike the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a>, there is no inherent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage immunity.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715103415\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 947/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6017/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2981/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 781/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643589/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.719      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.719      1 -total\n 38.41%   12.185      1 Template:Cond\n 33.85%   10.737      2 Template:Icon_link\n 32.48%   10.301      2 Template:Icon_text\n 28.63%    9.080      7 Template:Trim\n 28.48%    9.034      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 21.35%    6.773      2 Template:Ifempty\n 11.78%    3.738      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.44%    3.313      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17132-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715103415 and revision id 176926. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}